    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have arrived on the mysterious island to get the legendary cookie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary cookie is hidden deep within, guarded by terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, the island is home to powerful items that can enhance their abilities, allowing the girls to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 27 characters and 101 items available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve 87 achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to purchase items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items to become stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move using the W, A, S, and D keys. Attack using the arrow keys.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have arrived on the mysterious island to get the legendary cookie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary cookie is hidden deep within, guarded by terrifying monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately, the island is home to powerful items that can enhance their abilities, allowing the girls to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 27 characters and 101 items available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve 87 achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to purchase items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items to become stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move using the W, A, S, and D keys. Attack using the arrow keys.</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive against monsters to get the legendary cookie! Cookie Survivors is a top-down roguelite game. Combine various items to grow stronger until you get the legendary cookie!",
